                                "sense_id": "30b5f279-8aac-3002-bbf3-2507b3771f07",
                                "text": "The LAPD has asked Angelenos not to shoot at the alien spaceship, fearing it might trigger an interstellar war."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4bd86e6c-002e-4b8b-839f-0ee192a2365d",
                                "sense_id": "30b5f279-8aac-3002-bbf3-2507b3771f07",
                                "text": "He expressed his concerns through a series of histrionic rhetorical questions concerning L.A.’s shortcomings, all of which Sadie, a native Angeleno, already knew: Did she know about the earthquakes? The fires? The floods?"
                            }
                        ]
